  "description": "The META POWER SX V4 BOSCH RACE is a high-end assembly with ROCKSHOX suspension.\n• The latest ZEB Ultimate features the best from ROCKSHOX: a precise chassis, DebonAir+ air spring, ButterCups, decompression valves, and the brand's signature easy adjustment. A SuperDeluxe Ultimate shock with DebonAir+ spring is easily adjustable thanks to the high/low speed compression settings.\n• Stopping power is in the hands of the TRP DH-R EVO brakes - progressive and consistent - with 220mm TRP rotors.\n• DT SWISS HX1700 wheels are made of high-end aluminium. Designed for e-MTB use and assembled by hand, they are strong and reliable.\n• A SRAM GX twelve-speed drivetrain completes the build. Efficient and durable, it is perfectly suited to e-biking.",
